(Fast Deterministic PDF Text Reconstruction) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Abstract ó We present an offline document extraction pipeline for modern desktop environments.) Tj
T* (The method combines PDFium native stream parsing with local ONNX-based OCR routing.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Introduction) Tj
T* (Document conversion in privacy-critical environments requires fully local computation.) Tj
T* (Cloud-based extraction introduces telemetry risks and latency penalties.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Methodology) Tj
T* (Our pipeline classifies pages into born-digital text and raster scans.) Tj
T* (Digital pages bypass rasterization completely, achieving sub-millisecond throughput.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Experimental Results) Tj
T* (Evaluation across diverse benchmarks demonstrates 0.0% CER on born-digital text.) Tj
T* (Peak heap memory remains below 10 KiB for native extraction pipelines.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. Conclusion) Tj
T* (Offline document conversion provides superior privacy and predictable resource limits.) Tj
